	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quum mihi nudiustertius a <persName>Morellio</persName> nostro literę tę redditę <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>essent, commodum se obtulit hic nuncius, per quem te certiorem facerem e<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>as mihi fuisse gratissimas.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed obstitit adversa valetudo, quę <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>me in lecto hoc mane detinuit, quominus tibi rescriberem, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ut statueram.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Etsi autem iam nuncio excusaveram, pauca tamen <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>verba effutire malui quam illum prorsus inanem dimittere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Brevi <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>mittam Consensus nostri defensionem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed iam mature denuncio, scriptum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fore nec exacte politum, nec magni laboris: ne quid forte tibi <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>pręclarum spondeas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">De rerum nostrarum statu nihil scribo, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quod dubii adhuc pendemus: quod per nostrorum socordiam improbis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ludere non minus proterve quam impune liceat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Interim a vicinis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nostris plus quam atrociter proscindor.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nam agri <placeName ref="l41">Bernensis</placeName> concionatores <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>me hęreticum papistis omnibus deteriorem pro suggestu proclamant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Ac quo quisque petulantius in me bacchatur, eo plus sibi favoris <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et pręsidii comparat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quia satis expertus sum, nihil a fratribus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nostris sperandum esse, quos iniurię istę afficere debuerant, tacitus et <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quasi mutus quiesco.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Nec per me stabit, quominus improbi se expleant, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>atque etiam invidi saturentur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Interea respiciet dominus cęlo et <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>vindicabit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, ornatissime vir et mihi ex animo observande <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>frater.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta meo nomine d. <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName>, <persName ref="p7228">Zvinglium</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>generos, uxorem et familiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Dominus vos omnes custodiat, gubernet s<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>uo spiritu et omni benedictionis genere persequatur.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p974">Carolo <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Molinęo</persName> non respondeo, quia paulo ante scripseram.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Non parum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>vereor, ne bonę causę patrocinio eius obsit morositas.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Iterum v<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ale<note type="margin">a.R.: valle od. valde</note>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Collegę mei et complures amici vos reverenter salutant.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevę</placeName> 18. septemb. 1554.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName ref="p540">Ioannes Calvinus</persName> tuus<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Eximio Christi ministro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię fido pastori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fratri et symmystę colendissimo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>et integerrimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
